    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（板甲），非普通（需同調）</em><br />這套閃閃發光的銀金板甲永遠不會失去光澤。着裝這件盔甲期間，你可以用一個附贈動作召喚一位武者的精魂來協助你。精魂會以實體形態顯現在你選擇的距你30尺內的一個未被佔據的空間中，它使用<strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.monsterspack.Actor.D5UqYD1EnTrJaMTO]{騎士Knight}</strong>的資料。精魄會持續存在1分鐘，並在其生命值降至0時提前消失。精魂使用你的先攻，並且在你的回合後立即行動。精魂服從你的命令（無需動作）。如果你沒有發出命令，精魂就會在它的回合進行閃避@action[Dodge]動作並移動以躲避危險。此附贈動作一經使用，直到下次黎明前不能再次使用。</p><p>This gleaming set of silver-and-gold plate armor never tarnishes.</p><p>While wearing this armor, you can use a bonus action to summon the spirit of a warrior to your aid. The spirit's corporeal form manifests in an unoccupied space of your choice within 30 feet of you, and it uses the @creature[knight] stat block. The spirit disappears when it drops to 0 hit points or after 1 minute, whichever comes first.</p><p>The spirit is an ally to you and your companions. In combat, the spirit shares your initiative count but takes its turn immediately after yours. The spirit obeys your commands (no action required by you); if you don't issue any commands, the spirit takes the @action[Dodge] action and uses its movement to avoid danger.</p><p>Once this bonus action is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p><p>Plate consists of shaped, interlocking metal plates to cover the entire body. A suit of plate includes gauntlets, heavy leather boots, a visored helmet, and thick layers of padding underneath the armor. Buckles and straps distribute the weight over the body.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
